{"parse": {"title": "命运的雨季-07", "pageid": 123679, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-06\" title=\"命运的雨季-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">命运的雨季-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-08\" title=\"命运的雨季-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">命运的雨季</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.81.E8.A7.82.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"旁观者\">旁观者</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 旁观者</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Take No Sides</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿西娅：</div><div>灰调蓝小姐，您真的现在就要离开吗？但最优质的翠榴石还没找到呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我很遗憾，阿西娅，但我必须走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“冒险”的日子快活，但结果并非每次都能尽如人意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿西娅：</div><div>为什么？这太突然了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两天前，贝丽尔要求她们尽快返程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>勿忘我不再向贝丽尔提供精准情报，她只能依靠大不如前的占卜模糊地判断对方动向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灵摆中的景象显示重塑之手在加快行动，那就意味着“暴雨”会随时落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个理由却不能对眼前的人说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-642101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿西娅：</div><div>是不是贝丽尔女士对我们失望了？所以不想再与我们合作，让您离开？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……不是的，阿西娅，你多虑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿西娅的急切让灰调蓝不知该如何应对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>总之，你不必担心贝丽尔女士的态度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>最重要的是……阿西娅，你们得好好保重。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰调蓝回到巴黎的一周后，世界融化成表现主义的绘画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔布置着仪式，好奇地瞥了几眼灰调蓝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>印度之后，面对“暴雨”，你看起来与之前相比有了些许不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……意义并不系于宝石，它存在于“暴雨”停下后的世界里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>为此，我要靠近“雨”里的真相，所以我向您学习了。但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>您知道吗，贝丽尔女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>阿西娅同我告别时，还在担心您是否因为失望而不愿继续与他们合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>可他们不知道，他们的未来会在某一刻戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>有限的时间内，这是注定的结果，我并未因此失望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>况且我也寻到了替代品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>桌面中央一枚油绿色东陵石幽幽散着微光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>但这次，可能只能对仪式本身进行细微调整了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……我还是做不到像您这样，时刻都能抽离自身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>——这份彻底的“干净”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，贝丽尔布置仪式的动作蓦地停了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她定定望着那枚东陵石，微笑从脸上褪去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师并未应声。她的思绪落到某个极深的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>噢，大占卜师终于不愿再原地打转了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>费利西安的冷嘲热讽并未触及占卜师。她站起身，看向屋外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里没有窗，墙体阻隔了她的视线。但她明白，大雨正冲刷着所有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界将被雨水再次洗涤成另外的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站在岸边，目睹雨水在眼前降下，消逝，再度降下。周而复始。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您不该如此置身事外。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_2_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_2_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_2_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>太多人的命运在这里交汇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……你们的命运紧密相关。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔低下头，长长地叹了口气，仿佛如释重负。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再抬起脸时，她又恢复了寻常模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我确实，犹豫太久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她依次拾起桌面上摆放好的水晶，放回了行李中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，怎么了，您不开展仪式了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这次“暴雨”结束后，请去工房里为我找来所有白水晶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>要那些完全透明的、毫无杂质的白水晶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640915.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-640915.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640915.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640915.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-640915.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640915.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-640915.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640915.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>贝丽尔，你还要继续你这毫无起色的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这些白水晶我另有他用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>晦暗中，零星的光点在占卜师的眼底流动起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>呵，果然那些宝石对你来说，根本毫无价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔笑而不答，默认了这一指控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>那您打算……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>是时候给客人一个明确的答复了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>总不能让他等得太过心焦。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_guzhai2\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_guzhai2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔站在自家宅邸门前，耐心地等待着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多年前，克莱琳娜从这扇门里走了出来，重新涉足那条属于自己的洪流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>我很意外，您竟然主动联系我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>是什么让您更改了自己的想法？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我的想法从未变过。勿忘我先生，您依旧是我的客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我答应为您带来仪式所需的吼狮之尾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>“暴雨”之后，基金会内部管理混乱，漏洞百出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>在神秘学藏品管理部门内找到一个便于控制的人，的确不是难事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>但您要给予我应得的报酬——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>关于复活仪式的所有信息。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "命运的雨季-07"}}